MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1e7311bb0212e39408fe5fc2eeafe3e5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Ethan_Scammer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  victimName: Ethan Winters
  steps:
  - victimLine: Hey! Oh wow, it's been a while. What've you been up to lately?
    choices:
    - text: Ethan! Great timing. I just came into some serious money and thought
        of you.
      trustDelta: -12
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: Not much. Hey, have you ever looked into cryptocurrency investing?
      trustDelta: 8
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: Living the dream, man! Actually, I've got something exciting to tell
        you.
      trustDelta: 6
      isGood: 1
      label: 
  - victimLine: Ha, no way! How'd you manage that? Did you get a new job or something?
    choices:
    - text: No job, it's this crypto platform a buddy put me onto. Changed my life.
      trustDelta: -14
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: It's called CryptoVault. You put money in, the algorithm does the rest.
      trustDelta: 10
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: Kind of hard to explain over the phone, but it involves crypto trading.
      trustDelta: 4
      isGood: 1
      label: 
  - victimLine: Crypto? I dunno man, I've heard a lot of bad stories about that stuff.
    choices:
    - text: I said the same thing! That's exactly why I only trust this one platform.
      trustDelta: -16
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: Those bad stories are just people who didn't use the right system.
      trustDelta: 6
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: I get it. Honestly, just look at my withdrawal history. It's real.
      trustDelta: -4
      isGood: 0
      label: 
  - victimLine: I mean... how much are we actually talking here? Like real numbers.
    choices:
    - text: Last month alone I cleared $40k. I can show you the screenshots.
      trustDelta: -14
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: It varies. I don't want to overpromise, but it's been life-changing.
      trustDelta: 4
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: Enough that I quit worrying about bills. You could too, for just $500.
      trustDelta: -8
      isGood: 0
      label: 
  - victimLine: Wait, $500? So I have to pay to join? That sounds like one of those
      scam things.
    choices:
    - text: It's not a fee, it's your starting investment, you own that money still.
      trustDelta: -16
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: Think of it like a membership. Every legit platform has a starting buy-in.
      trustDelta: 6
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: I thought the same! But I got it all back in the first week, easy.
      trustDelta: -6
      isGood: 0
      label: 
  - victimLine: If it's so good, why do you need me to join? Why not just keep it
      to yourself?
    choices:
    - text: I get a referral bonus, I won't lie, but you'd profit way more than I
        do.
      trustDelta: -12
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: Because you're my friend, Ethan. I'd feel guilty keeping this from you.
      trustDelta: 4
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: Honestly the more people join, the better the algorithm performs for
        all of us.
      trustDelta: -4
      isGood: 0
      label: 
  - victimLine: A referral bonus? So you make money off me signing up. That feels
      kinda off.
    choices:
    - text: It's like a finder's fee, totally standard in investing. Check any broker.
      trustDelta: -14
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: I understand the hesitation. Want me to send you some info to review
        first?
      trustDelta: 10
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: You're overthinking it, man. My whole family is on this. Even my mom.
      trustDelta: -6
      isGood: 0
      label: 
  - victimLine: I don't know... can I at least look up this CryptoVault platform
      first?
    choices:
    - text: Of course! Just know the public site is separate from the private member
        portal.
      trustDelta: -16
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: The thing is, it's invite-only. You won't find much publicly. Trust the
        results.
      trustDelta: 6
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: Totally, but the window closes tonight, so don't take too long.
      trustDelta: -10
      isGood: 0
      label: 
  - victimLine: Tonight?! Why's there a deadline, why can't I just join next week?
    choices:
    - text: New member slots open monthly, I just don't want you to wait another
        30 days.
      trustDelta: -18
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: You know what, forget the deadline. Take your time, I just wanted to
        help.
      trustDelta: 14
      isGood: 1
      label: Vague pressure close
    - text: It's a limited pool thing, too many investors dilutes everyone's returns.
      trustDelta: -8
      isGood: 0
      label: 
